# Legatto application stack: docker compose project "legatto" from
# /opt/legatto/current/compose (upstream Supabase copy + docker-compose.legatto.yml).
# Release-delivered (applier systemd-unit); runs only the Ansible-installed tool.
# No ExecStop: stopping this unit must not stop the database. Updates use
# `systemctl reload` (idempotent `docker compose up -d --remove-orphans --wait`).
[Unit]
Description=Legatto application stack (docker compose project legatto)
Requires=docker.service legatto-secrets-render.service
After=docker.service legatto-secrets-render.service network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
RemainAfterExit=yes
ExecStart=/opt/legatto/sbin/legatto-stack up
ExecReload=/opt/legatto/sbin/legatto-stack up
TimeoutStartSec=15min

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
